From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 01:00:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: exynos9820: Add CMU_FSYS1 and its system
 registers

The embedded storage of this SoC hangs off CMU_FSYS1, and the bits that
decide whether its transfers are coherent live in the FSYS1 system
register block beside it.  Neither is described yet, so add both.

The clock controller takes the six inputs its binding asks for.  Two of
them are the ones the storage will use: the bus clock the controller
runs on, and the clock of the embedded link, whose rate every timing of
that link is computed from.  Both are the same parents this node is
given in the boot loader of this phone, where the link comes up at high
speed gear three on two lanes.

The system register block carries the shareability bits at offset 0x700.
Describing it as a syscon lets the storage controller reach them through
a phandle, which is how the driver expects to find them, rather than
through a register window of its own.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820.dtsi | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820.dtsi
index 825ff786249..c8af0abed79 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820.dtsi
@@ -364,6 +364,28 @@ pinctrl_fsys0: pinctrl@13030000 {
 			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 240 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
 		};
 
+		cmu_fsys1: clock-controller@13c00000 {
+			compatible = "samsung,exynos9820-cmu-fsys1";
+			reg = <0x13c00000 0x8000>;
+			#clock-cells = <1>;
+
+			clocks = <&oscclk>,
+				 <&cmu_top CLK_GOUT_CMU_FSYS1_BUS>,
+				 <&cmu_top CLK_GOUT_CMU_FSYS1_MMC_CARD>,
+				 <&cmu_top CLK_DOUT_CMU_FSYS1_PCIE>,
+				 <&cmu_top CLK_DOUT_CMU_FSYS1_UFS_CARD>,
+				 <&cmu_top CLK_DOUT_CMU_FSYS1_UFS_EMBD>;
+			clock-names = "oscclk", "bus", "mmc_card", "pcie",
+				      "ufs_card", "ufs_embd";
+		};
+
+		sysreg_fsys1: syscon@13c10000 {
+			compatible = "samsung,exynos9820-fsys1-sysreg",
+				     "syscon";
+			reg = <0x13c10000 0x2000>;
+			clocks = <&cmu_fsys1 CLK_GOUT_FSYS1_SYSREG_FSYS1_PCLK>;
+		};
+
 		pinctrl_fsys1: pinctrl@13c40000 {
 			compatible = "samsung,exynos9820-pinctrl";
 			reg = <0x13c40000 0x1000>;
